{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "0821943210808f6eea9ad2beff7b9cf48128897311cb4fb57a49624743cb0187", "ja": "新企画、始動！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ad8c55ae4de2dd5e255ac4005ad231e92194d64640da801f0023b7d5d7d9734f", "ja": "世界的な動画配信企業『ネットスワイプス』\nから、新規立ち上げの音楽配信番組の打診が\n来た。誰もが知るネトスワからのオファーと\n聞いて、盛り上がるアイドルたち。ひとまず\n前向きに検討してみることに。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "82f7954fe9f96a0a3014c0bc36dfb2f6b8502dc7dfc700e8a600aaeeaa0e60fd", "ja": "（『ネトスワ』への返答に悩んでいると、\nいきなり先方からメールが来た。なになに……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1001_null", "source_sha256": "5d7b791ed48f5334a9c67e0cadcdee749b762819d3eb96c3ad50dfbae54f286e", "ja": "『番組で使う予定の新曲を送付いたします。\n添付ファイルをご確認ください』", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "239aa0a5aab0946e2dad0bd588872ea06d50354fc37b98a002b0073f15c4e9d5", "ja": "（えっ、まだ何も決まってないのに？\n流石超大手、速度感がすごいな……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "603d9ffc92bf08612f00d440a75b1d2b4c336d7139e99f11ab3944031c928b71", "ja": "……{$P$}？\nどうしたのですか？　ボンヤリして。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d2b4e44ac60b55c99b331f8d54ff436f46488c7807dbbdfcd06abe9ac9c95d31", "ja": "あっ、ゴメン。\nえっと……今、何の話してたんだっけ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "e1edf96ed0f6599d377784730e2756538d007899f9b5d3ad50384ce0d98deb0d", "ja": "私たちのスケジュールの話です！\nお休みが終わったから、どうしようかな～って！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "a68edb129fdc133fc9552a3d0965f4a331e30c18c67a21bbce79562d970c25f6", "ja": "新学期、始まったし……。みんなの予定、確認して\nおくって……{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bcd69c3a18715a5f30eb17e41f7382c7b1435d0a654302d98e9b28303c417893", "ja": "あの……大丈夫ですか？\n残暑も厳しいですし、まさか、頭が……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "2ae88cbbe1ad404870e80ac39552f415a4c45ab27ff25a35c0350785dffe1ab9", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}さん、\n頭がどうかしちゃったんですか！？　わーん！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "cc99d22147a432516380e122b4c52965b26d1ed8b6135f300c806cdcdccb7485", "ja": "大変……すぐに冷却、しなきゃ……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "23fc37f7f29ced91ab280a7cbe807aa80d3872e9955b8918c636622f2127d5c8", "ja": "い、いや。ちょっと考え事してただけだから、\n大丈夫だよ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "30046550e779d479d180362f617d971c13af87b544cfc5e96d3fe27e5c696f64", "ja": "えっと、杏奈はしばらく\nオフって事でいいんだったよな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "e13394f7da188e9b20b0423cf52b9d6b443704dbd5918547894f73074fc8b020", "ja": "ん……。予定は、そう、だけど……。\n杏奈、別にお仕事でも、大丈夫、だよ……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "418ede88d9d0a88dfaf53ae1032a0d0712b656093b8b2bd979a47175f1b6b542", "ja": "いや、杏奈は最近仕事が詰まり気味だったからな。\nこっちとしても、休んでもらいたい。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "025eeeead2f29bd7b5bd35d6c7ce8ec83688519dfb6fed3bb77790eb63b99d2b", "ja": "わかった……。DLC、出るから……\n今のうちに、やる……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "141d41b9b3a5aa5dad6fd7402362b490652c7b8efb57f2745cc2e10c0aab32dd", "ja": "DLCって、ゲーム……だったっけ？\n杏奈ちゃん、ゲーム休暇ってやつだね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "69eac02942830035624e755e8a7f8510637912d1befc7d61d9926e7c80527bb1", "ja": "オトナっぽ～い♪　オトナはそういう休み方を\nするって、小鳥さんと美咲ちゃんが話してたもん。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "76058ac0cabbb2b3572313dc82cccb487f9244f5b9224e0bc5750e1526fbee7b", "ja": "そう……かな……？\nそう、かも……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2fe139cab6bc2c97fd1b1b31a3fb4525821616d4eb641a0c81fb3b07aeeb4613", "ja": "それじゃ、今日のところはこの辺で……あ、そうだ。\nみんな、ネトスワってわかるか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd9f8d523768498ab83b0a169dc9a411d821ef70d83016203d55d04fb5297996", "ja": "ネットスワイプスですよね！\nうちはサブスク見放題～♪　その日の気分しだい～♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "e4e0d499b8e3426c55543d749901c141e645444a4989eb231045a83bd133cf85", "ja": "うちも、お茶の間のテレビでたまに見てまーす！\n映画とか、アニメが多いかも？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6b7ef80c51dedb207c0fa8c422cd23cc9bb430c125bc652da207f83869f65b16", "ja": "むしろ、私たちがネトスワを\n知らないほど世間知らずだ、と……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6000c0a716a0899489eecd51e164f7d048f45d48ff633cc2a5e7c1e64abc8a19", "ja": "ち、違う違う！　そこは一応聞いてみただけで。\n杏奈は……もちろん、知ってそうだな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "d75c54016de46bce016bb1ff651583a3a0635250ba9253c495d6cf3fbbb512b4", "ja": "ん……うちは、見たい番組がある時、だけ……\n課金する……感じ、です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "258c94270d54ae4a090258139c31071523e848c9fefd8acbe316f10ca95ced56", "ja": "なるほど……やっぱりそうだよな。十代にも\n認知度があって、概ね好意的。うーん……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "e83bfbcde9db0a4884fde1528ecd0c1ae5758c9682b454f9a736e809a18733da", "ja": "？　どうしたんですか？\nあ、もしかして、気になる番組があるとか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a6baac07307f6c5196598dd1011030105c281294ec071b9bb403a098bf05cacc", "ja": "いや……これはまだオフレコでお願いしたいんだけど、\n実は、そのネトスワから仕事の話が来てるんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a4ac3963d46f34115f02dd7f34897b45bb08c8d28fd0eac294992e714cefe396", "ja": "まだやるって返事もしてないのに、\nもう曲も送られてきてて……これなんだけど。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "475ed2f016577dda8b3b8df263cf5bc82dd9d80d5e30a5b6f414b677518a8bb4", "ja": "……どうかな？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2001_036kan", "source_sha256": "66811d3e2b0b24a676db5c81b77841b7541205f957bc01cce95018f949907881", "ja": "わぁっ、いい曲！　オトナっぽいな～。\nふんふんふ～ん……♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2002_014mir", "source_sha256": "7bb125495715bd7bd52a1a05eba2239c409c92d0163ce889b5e6c61ca57d59b0", "ja": "カッコいい～！　私、これ歌ってみたいかも？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "39edfd55250671dd2c0adb0c375eb3b14c5fc74e6b83243f51842beb7de42fda", "ja": "確かに、いい曲だと思いますが……\n逆に、何が問題なのですか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2004_p", "source_sha256": "7358cc9bcb4dacae149ecfe6c6627934d8a8b320238fd929eac8ad087fae54b4", "ja": "そうだよな。ただ、先方とうちとで\n方針が合うかどうかで、悩んでたんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2005_p", "source_sha256": "80f3e84339749b3821ba18aa3873ea80987cee47e030b44b197f177df928d6a9", "ja": "けどみんなの反応も悪くないし、何より大きな\nチャンスだしな。前向きに検討してみる事にするよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2006_014mir", "source_sha256": "afc84058e23fe157a4d07750f6eefc6180878a84788f12a9b845b8afc1eac01a", "ja": "わーい！　決まったら、ネトスワの仕事だよって\nお父さんとお母さんに自慢しちゃおうっと♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2007_p", "source_sha256": "1e91874ed305d3d946482b12614fa6e996de0e365665b3448089bb2f43b70891", "ja": "一度みんなで遊びに来てくださいって言われてるし、\nとりあえず、杏奈以外の3人で行ってみるか。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2008_024ann", "source_sha256": "1d83874719029e09125ac1c85b46b304b5ee603644761af92800a9f7c981777a", "ja": "え……？\n杏奈も、行ける……よ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2009_p", "source_sha256": "6bb0516dd83d4553e48d8893c67149b252ce181a97ef372521e5e24d6a85d0ca", "ja": "休むのも仕事のうちだから大丈夫だよ。\n勿論、本格始動となったら杏奈にも参加してもらう！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2010_p", "source_sha256": "ab789073c6098b7e8af4ed69361e596a5661e21af69857bea1ef690d3b47846d", "ja": "今は、任せておいてくれ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2011_024ann", "source_sha256": "db3f73c7c59110ae03f2cfe7eafe132f84999906c29354aa0352a7dbe042c56e", "ja": "ん……わかった。\nみんなに、任せる……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0448_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0448_story_01_2012_p", "source_sha256": "e7d1ed1d372582355a8f45d882538d8f8c378ac967fd50cda37e002a164969ce", "ja": "（慎重さは大事だけど、臆病になっても始まらない。\nここは、飛び込んでみるとしよう！）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
